            "id": "4948050",
            "title": "What Moved Markets This Week",
            "description": "<html><body><div class=\"wsb_wrapper\"> <div class=\"wsb_main\"><span><p data-eci=\"true\"><strong>Listen on the go! A daily podcast of Wall Street Breakfast will be available by 8:00 a.m. on <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/author/wall-street-breakfast?utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_medium=toptext&amp;utm_campaign=wsbpodpromo\">Seeking Alpha</a>, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/wall-street-breakfast/id1358381502\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">iTunes</a>, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/05uLjJxkVgQsRk8LWLCLpx\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Spotify</a>.</strong></p></span></div> <figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture><img alt=\"\" data-id=\"2149954800\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2149954800/image_2149954800.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" width=\"100%\"/><figcaption><p class=\"item-credits\">bodrumsurf/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></picture></figure>\n<p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\"></p> <p><span class=\"b italic\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">Up for a challenge? Test your knowledge on the biggest events in the investing world over the past week. Take the latest <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/quiz/69-investment-news-quiz-friday-sep-18-2026-09-18\">Seeking Alpha News Quiz</a> and see how you stack up against the competition.</span></p> <p></p> <h2></h2> <p></p> <p><br/>Wall Street closed the trading week mixed, as the Federal Reserve raised interest rates, Treasury yields climbed, and leading AI lab executives called to slow advanced model development.<br/><br/>The Federal Open Market Committee, guided by Chair Kevin Warsh, <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4643474-federal-reserve-hikes-rate-to-375-400-first-increase-in-three-years\" target=\"_blank\">voted to raise</a> the benchmark federal funds rate by a quarter percentage point to a target range of 3.75% to 4%—marking the first rate hike since 2023—as inflation remained stubbornly above target.<br/><br/>Leading AI lab executives, including Anthropic's (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ANTHRO\" title=\"Anthropic\">ANTHRO</a>) Dario Amodei and OpenAI's (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/OPENAI\" title=\"OpenAI\">OPENAI</a>) Sam Altman, publicly <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642266-anthropic-ceo-amodei-calls-slow-pace-ai-model-improvements\" target=\"_blank\">called to slow</a> the rapid pace of frontier AI model development to establish better safety guardrails.<br/><br/>In the bond market, the benchmark 10-year Treasury yield (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/US10Y\">US10Y</a>) <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642740-us-10-year-treasury-yield-climbs-to-highest-level-since-2007-ahead-of-fed-decision\" target=\"_blank\">climbed</a> to its highest level in nearly two decades as resurfacing inflation fears and rising oil prices (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/USO\" title=\"United States Oil Fund LP ETF\">USO</a>) (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BNO\" title=\"United States Brent Oil Fund LP ETF\">BNO</a>) weighed on investor sentiment.<br/><br/>For the week, the blue-chip Dow (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DJI\" title=\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Index\">DJI</a>) fell <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-1.7%</span>, the benchmark S&amp;P (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SP500\">SP500</a>) ticked down <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-0.1%</span>, and the tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COMP:IND\" title=\"NASDAQ Composite Index\">COMP:IND</a>) rose <span class=\"green\" style=\"color: #008000;\">+0.7%</span>. <br/><br/>Read a preview of next week's major events in <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4643472-catalyst-watch-trump-xi-in-dc-meta-connect-and-mcdonalds-investor-day\" target=\"_blank\">Seeking Alpha's Catalyst Watch.</a><br/><br/></p> <p></p> <h2><a class=\"!no-underline !text-share-text\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4644286-inflation-nation-are-record-income-gains-already-gone\">Record earnings</a></h2> <p>Americans' income hit a new record in 2025, shedding light on households' financial well-being before the Iran war exacerbated inflation. U.S. real median household income was $87,460 in 2025, the highest since 1967, when the Census Bureau started tracking the data. But income growth was not evenly felt across demographics, and with the current affordability crisis, will these gains continue? <span class=\"b\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4644286-inflation-nation-are-record-income-gains-already-gone\">Read more.</a></span></p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Seeking Alpha's Calls Of The Week</p> <p>IonQ's (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/IONQ\" title=\"IonQ, Inc.\">IONQ</a>) Historic Low Valuation <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4946829-ionqs-historic-low-valuation-meets-record-breaking-guidance-upgrade\">Meets Record Guidance</a>.<br/><br/>AppLovin (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/APP\" title=\"AppLovin Corporation\">APP</a>): Gaming Closed Gap E-Commerce <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4946841-applovin-gaming-just-closed-the-gap-e-commerce-was-meant-to-upgrade-cautious-buy\">Was Meant To</a>.<br/><br/>Generac (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/GNRC\" title=\"Generac Holdings Inc.\">GNRC</a>): Amazon (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AMZN\" title=\"Amazon.com, Inc.\">AMZN</a>) Gives The <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4947851-generac-amazon-gives-the-story-more-credibility\">Story More Credibility</a>.<br/><br/>Devon Energy's (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DVN\" title=\"Devon Energy Corporation\">DVN</a>) Stronger Permian Focus, <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4946670-devon-energy-stronger-permian-focus-and-valuation-support-rating-upgrade\">Valuation Support</a>.<br/><br/>Petrobras (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PBR\" title=\"Petróleo Brasileiro S.A. - Petrobras\">PBR</a>) Dividends Create An Absurdity - <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4946978-petrobras-q4-dividends-create-an-absurdity-yield-exceeds-pe-rating-upgrade\">Yield Exceeds P/E</a>.<br/><br/>Agnico Eagle (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AEM\" title=\"Agnico Eagle Mines Limited\">AEM</a>) Is Great, But The Valuation <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4947097-agnico-eagle-great-company-but-the-valuation-has-caught-up-rating-downgrade\">Has Caught Up</a>.<br/><br/>Downgrading Intel (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/INTC\" title=\"Intel Corporation\">INTC</a>) - No Bad Products, <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4946746-intel-no-bad-products-just-bad-prices-rating-downgrade\">Just Bad Prices</a>.<br/><br/>Sell Radiant Logistics' (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/RLGT\" title=\"Radiant Logistics, Inc.\">RLGT</a>) Earnings <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4947252-radiant-logistics-sell-the-earnings-stock-price-spike-rating-downgrade\">Stock Price Spike</a>.<br/><br/>Rubrik (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/RBRK\" title=\"Rubrik, Inc.\">RBRK</a>): I See Little Margin Of Safety <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4947603-rubrik-downgrading-to-sell-theres-no-margin-of-safety\">For Investors Here</a>.<br/><br/>Bearish On Shutterstock (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SSTK\" title=\"Shutterstock, Inc.\">SSTK</a>) Amid <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4946088-shutterstock-downgrade-to-sell-due-to-deteriorating-fundamentals\">Deteriorating Fundamentals</a>.</p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Weekly Movement</p> <p></p> <p><span style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; margin-top: 0px !important; padding: 5px 0 0;\"><strong>U.S. Indices</stro